1
00:00:00,244 --> 00:00:01,844
(Howard:)Really? Why?

2
00:00:01,845 --> 00:00:03,575
(Raj:)They exist
in case we ever make contact

3
00:00:03,581 --> 00:00:04,981
(Raj:)with an alien civilization.

4
00:00:04,982 --> 00:00:08,522
(Howard:)Mm, boy, that's one of those
jobs that's boring, boring,

5
00:00:08,519 --> 00:00:10,319
boring, then, "Oh, God!

6
00:00:10,321 --> 00:00:13,591
(Howard:)Where's the memo
with what we do now?!"

7
00:00:13,591 --> 00:00:14,621
(phone chimes)

8
00:00:14,625 --> 00:00:16,255
(Raj:)Oh, this is cool.

9
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,630
(Raj:)So, a few weeks ago,
I set up a fan page

10
00:00:18,629 --> 00:00:21,359
(Raj:)on Facebook for our band and...
Wait a second.

11
00:00:21,365 --> 00:00:24,805
(Howard:)How could you do that
without consulting me?

12
00:00:24,802 --> 00:00:25,832
(Raj:)It's not a big deal.

13
00:00:25,836 --> 00:00:27,106
(Raj:)It just took, like,
five minutes to set up.

14
00:00:27,104 --> 00:00:28,704
(Howard:)That's not the point.

15
00:00:28,706 --> 00:00:31,536
(Howard:)When we created
Footprints on the Moon,

16
00:00:31,542 --> 00:00:35,242
(Howard:)we agreed that every band
decision would be mutual.

17
00:00:35,245 --> 00:00:37,545
(Howard:)Now you're just trying to
take over the whole thing.

18
00:00:37,548 --> 00:00:40,988
(Amy:)You know,
maybe I should go solo.

19
00:00:40,985 --> 00:00:43,015
(Raj:)But someone joined
our page.

20
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,990
(Raj:)We have an actual fan.

21
00:00:44,989 --> 00:00:46,889
(Howard:)All right.

22
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:49,220
(Howard:)This thing's bigger than you
and me... band's back together.

23
00:00:51,362 --> 00:00:52,792
(Raj:)So, listen to what he wrote.

24
00:00:52,796 --> 00:00:55,596
Uh, "I saw you play
at the comic book store.

25
00:00:55,599 --> 00:00:56,929
You guys rock."

26
00:00:56,934 --> 00:00:59,234
(Raj:)And then there's
a animated smiley face

